    "description": "Joins biological CSV and TSV tables using relational join semantics with optional identifier normalization for life-science keys such as Ensembl gene IDs, UniProt accessions, and sample barcodes. The browser workspace runs the same join engine as the PyPI-distributed Python client and CLI, which call the Pepkio Tools API for scripted pipelines. Calculator logic executes on Pepkio servers; the client transmits table text and join options and returns merged tables with match statistics and shareable run identifiers.",
